        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-5THEOREMS-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-ANNSIM-5THEOREMS-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH1-SPATIO-BIM-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH2-TEMPORAL-SYNC-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH3-LYAPUNOV-THERMAL-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH4-PRIVACY-ANONYMITY-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH5-RULE18-PARITY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-MASTER-PROOF-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-THEOREMS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-THEOREMS.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH1-SPATIO-BIM-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH2-TEMPORAL-SYNC-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH3-LYAPUNOV-THERMAL-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH4-PRIVACY-ANONYMITY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH5-RULE18-PARITY-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-MASTER-PROOF-CODE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-MASTER-PROOF-CODE.
